# Informatica API (removed)

`wcp_library.informatica` was removed in 1.15.0. Informatica is no longer used
as a product at WCAP, so the module and its `InformaticaSession` client are
gone; there is no replacement in this library.

If you have reached this page from an old link or an older pinned version of
the library, the last release containing the module is **1.14.11**. The code
remains in the repository history.

This page is kept rather than deleted so the link resolves to an explanation
instead of a missing page.
